[h1]Suggestions[/h1]
Ideas for new features, changes to existing ones, and translation corrections go here. One suggestion per reply so each can be discussed and tracked on its own. Bugs go in the Bug Reports thread, questions in the Questions thread.

[h2]What helps[/h2]
[list]
    [*]The problem you are trying to solve, not only the feature you have in mind. A different solution is sometimes already possible.
    [*]Where in the Palpedia it would live (list, filter panel, sort panel, search bar, detail page).
    [*]For translation fixes: the game language, the exact current text, and the text you propose.
[/list]

[h2]Ground rules[/h2]
[list]
    [*]Everything stays client-side. Suggestions that would need the server, or would change what other players see, are out of scope.
    [*]The mod only uses the game's own buttons, font and sounds. New art is not on the table.
    [*]Keyboard and mouse only, same as UE4SS itself.
[/list]

[h2]What happens next[/h2]
Accepted suggestions ship in a MINOR update and are listed in the Change Notes tab. A reply in this thread will say which version carries it. Declined ones get a reply with the reason.
